@startuml Sequence Diagram - Webhook Notification
title Escenario 4 - Notificacion Webhook (Simulator API)
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #666666
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #666666

participant "Scenario Engine" as Engine
participant "Simulator API\n(Fastify)" as SimAPI
participant "Comercio\n(Webhook Endpoint)" as Comercio
participant "SDK KitPagos" as SDK

note left of Engine
  tras crear el pago con scenario "webhook",
  SE agenda el evento asincrono
end note
Engine -> SimAPI : construir payload nativo + firma simulada
SimAPI -> Comercio : POST {webhookUrl}(rawBody, headers)
Comercio -> SDK : verifyWebhookSignature(VerifyWebhookRequest)

alt firma valida
  SDK --> Comercio : true
  Comercio -> SDK : processWebhookEvent(VerifyWebhookRequest)
  SDK -> SDK : parseWebhookEvent -> normalizar status
  SDK --> Comercio : TransactionStatusResponse{transactionStatus,\nrawStatus}
  Comercio -> Comercio : actualizar orden interna
else firma invalida
  SDK -->x Comercio : false
  Comercio -->x Comercio : descartar evento\n(SdkError WEBHOOK_SIGNATURE_INVALID)
end

note over Engine, SDK
  Wompi: header X-Event-Checksum + body signature.checksum (SHA-256)
  Rapyd: header signature (Base64 HMAC-SHA256 sobre
  url_path+salt+timestamp+access_key+secret_key+body);
  salt/timestamp/access_key en headers separados
  Mercado Pago: header x-signature ts=/v1= (HMAC-SHA256)
  Kushki: mecanismo de firma (!) PENDIENTE (no documentado
  en fuentes oficiales)
end note

@enduml
